---
const clips = [
  {
    id: '01-agent-checks-suspicious-mail',
    title: 'Ask an agent to inspect suspicious mail',
    duration: '43s',
    description: 'A recorded agent session searches a synthetic inbox, checks message headers, and reports suspicious senders.',
    provenance: 'Excerpt from a recorded synthetic-inbox session. GPT-5.5 is visible in the capture; the recording date and mxr version are not identified.',
    steps: [
      'The prompt asks for likely phishing or scam senders and says not to change anything.',
      'The agent searches inbox messages for suspicious phrases and inspects selected headers.',
      'It returns a short list of senders to verify; the clip does not establish current model quality.',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: '02-agent-searches-local-mail',
    title: 'Have an agent search the synthetic inbox',
    duration: '20s',
    description: 'An excerpt shows an agent form a mail search and inspect matching messages from a synthetic inbox.',
    provenance: 'Excerpt from the same recorded synthetic-inbox agent session as clips 01, 03, and 04. GPT-5.5 is visible; date and mxr version are not identified.',
    steps: [
      'The agent receives a request to check the inbox for likely phishing or scam senders.',
      'It runs an mxr search for suspicious wording and reads the returned matches.',
      'This is a recorded excerpt, not a current capability or model-quality test.',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: '03-agent-builds-a-query',
    title: 'Let an agent compose a search pipeline',
